   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "strangler-proxy is the only NodePort; every other Service (including graphql-gateway's own front door) stays ClusterIP. Probes: tcpSocket on strangler-proxy + review-service (no /health route), httpGet /health on the other six.",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "strangler-proxy is the only NodePort; every other Service (including graphql-gateway's own front door) stays ClusterIP. Probes: tcpSocket on strangler-proxy + review-service (no /health route), httpGet /health on the other six.",
